WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:05.486
Here's how to set up your Title22 Classroom account, and use it with your students.

00:05.736 --> 00:11.100
First, create your account at title22.app, with the email you teach from.

00:11.793 --> 00:20.058
Then tell the Title22 team which email you used. They turn on your Classroom account. It's free, and it does not expire.

00:20.661 --> 00:23.294
Sign in again, and tap Show me around.

00:23.946 --> 00:27.439
This is your practice home. Everyone in it is invented.

00:27.689 --> 00:30.130
Open the menu, and tap Lessons.

00:31.251 --> 00:36.551
Tap Load starter lessons. You get ready-made lessons, each with its own questions.

00:37.198 --> 00:45.193
Every lesson is yours to change. Tap Edit to rewrite the reading. Untick Show this lesson to students, and it stays a draft.

00:45.443 --> 00:48.702
Tap Questions to change what your students are asked.

00:48.952 --> 00:53.150
Now bring your class in. Open the menu, and tap Team access.

00:53.400 --> 01:01.203
Tap Invite Member. Type your student's email, and choose Supervisor, so they can follow the practice steps and submit answers.

01:01.453 --> 01:05.928
Tap Generate Invite Link. Copy the link, and send it to your student.

01:06.178 --> 01:10.731
Your student creates an account with that same email, then opens your link.

01:11.335 --> 01:15.014
This is your student's screen. They open a lesson, and read it.

01:15.989 --> 01:21.374
Then they answer the questions, and tap Submit answers. They see which ones they got right.

01:27.180 --> 01:32.508
Back on your screen, tap Results on any lesson. You see every submission, with the score.

01:32.758 --> 01:36.146
These are practice answers. They are not a training record.

01:36.396 --> 01:40.779
Questions? Write to hello@title-22.com.
